---
// A cloud outline behind a diagram node (the internet, Cloudflare's edge):
// five bumps on a flat base, drawn bigger than the node's text box so the
// words sit in its body. The node must be position: relative.
---

<svg
  class="cl"
  viewBox="20 4 214 108"
  preserveAspectRatio="none"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path
    d="M50 104A24 24 0 1 1 58 57.4A30 30 0 0 1 100.5 30.7A36 36 0 0 1 168.5 33.7A28 28 0 0 1 205.7 56.1A24 24 0 0 1 204 104Z"
  ></path>
</svg>

<style>
  /* Behind the node's text but above the diagram's edges: the node is its own
     stacking context, so an edge that ends at the text box is hidden under the
     outline instead of crossing into it. */
  .cl {
    position: absolute;
    left: -0.9rem;
    top: -1.7rem;
    width: calc(100% + 1.8rem);
    height: calc(100% + 2.2rem);
    z-index: -1;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  path {
    fill: var(--panel);
    stroke: var(--n8);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }
</style>
